    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>title=SD01 - Generate Weekly Meal Plan   (UC04; F01, F03, F04, F05, F06, F11, F12)
obj=Meal Planner~U ACTOR
obj=:MealPlanningGUI~GUI
obj=:MealPlanningApi~API
obj=:MealPlanningFacade~F
obj=:AgentController~AC
obj=:MealPlanningAgent~AG
obj=:PlanningStrategyFactory~SF
obj=strategy:\nPlanningStrategy~ST
obj=:ToolManager~TM
obj=:RecipeTool~RT
obj=:PromptBuilder~PB
obj=:ProviderLLMAdapter\n«LLMClient»~LLM
obj=External LLM API\n«external»~EXT
obj=:ProposalValidator~PV
obj=:ConstraintValidator~CV
obj=:NutritionService~NS
obj=:BudgetService~BS
obj=:MealPlanService~MPS
obj=:MealPlanRepository~MPR

U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 1: Generate plan (start date,\ndays, mode)
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;API : 2: postPlan(request) via\nHTTP; on=API
API-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 3: generateWeeklyPlan(\nrequest); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 4: generateWeeklyPlan(\nrequest); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC + : 5:\nbuildContext(\nrequest)
tick=1
combinedFragment=loop~L AC BS; AG:[attempt &lt;= 2 and proposal not yet valid]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG : 6: createPlanProposal(\ncontext); on=AG
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;SF : 7: strategyFor(context); on=SF
SF-&gt;&gt;&gt;SF + : 8:\ncreateStrategy(\nmode)
tick=1
SF-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST : 9: configure(profile)
SF.&gt;AG : 10: NutritionGoal / Budget /\nTimeAware strategy; off=SF
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 11: availableTools(); on=TM
TM.&gt;AG : 12: recipeSearch, nutrition, grocery, substitution; off=TM
combinedFragment=loop~T AG EXT; SF:[step &lt;= maxToolSteps and LLM has not signalled "ready to plan"]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;PB : 13: buildToolSelectionPrompt(context, goal, tools, results); on=PB
PB.&gt;AG : 14: prompt; off=PB
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 15: generateStructured(prompt, NextAction schema); on=LLM
LLM-&gt;&gt;&gt;EXT : 16: createStructuredResponse(\nrequest); on=EXT
EXT.&gt;LLM : 17: structured response; off=EXT
LLM.&gt;AG : 18: next action: tool call, or "ready to plan"; off=LLM
combinedFragment=alt~D AG EXT; SF:[valid tool call, e.g. recipeSearch]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 19: isValidCall(toolName, args); on=TM
TM.&gt;AG : 20: true; off=TM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 21: execute(toolName, args); on=TM
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;RT : 22: execute(args); on=RT
RT-&gt;&gt;&gt;RT + : 23:\nsearchRecipes(\nquery)
tick=1
RT.&gt;TM : 24: ToolResult(candidates); off=RT
TM.&gt;AG : 25: ToolResult; off=TM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST : 26: rank(candidates, context); on=ST
ST.&gt;AG : 27: ranked candidates added to results; off=ST
..=D; SF:[LLM asks for a custom recipe for a slot]
ref=AG EXT : SD05 Find or Generate Recipe - generateRecipe(context, query)
..=D; SF:[unknown tool or invalid arguments]
text=AG:call is not executed, the error\nis added to results for the next\nstep
..=D; SF:["ready to plan"]
text=AG:tool phase ends
--=D
--=T
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;PB : 28: buildPlanningPrompt(context, ranked); on=PB
PB.&gt;AG : 29: prompt; off=PB
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 30: generateStructured(prompt, PlanningProposal schema); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 31: proposal data (provider call as above); off=LLM
AG.&gt;AC : 32: PlanningProposal (meals,\nrationale, conflicts); off=AG
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;PV : 33: validate(proposal, context); on=PV
PV.&gt;AC : 34: ValidationResult (schema, recipe ids, slot count); off=PV
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 35: validatePlan(proposal, context); on=CV
text=CV:checks via\nvalidateRestrictions()\nand validateTime()
CV-&gt;&gt;&gt;NS : 36: calculateNutrition(meals); on=NS
NS.&gt;CV : 37: NutritionSummary; off=NS
CV-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS : 38: estimateCost(meals, pantry); on=BS
BS.&gt;CV : 39: estimated cost; off=BS
CV.&gt;AC : 40: ValidationResult; off=CV
text=AC:violations are added to\ncontext for the next attempt
--=L
combinedFragment=alt~A GUI MPR; API:[proposal valid]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 41: createFromProposal(proposal); on=MPS
MPS-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPR : 42: save(plan)
MPS.&gt;AC : 43: MealPlan; off=MPS
AC.&gt;F : 44: AgentResponse(SUCCESS,\nplan, rationale)
..=A; API:[still invalid after 2 attempts]
AC.&gt;F : 45: AgentResponse(\nCONFLICT, violations,\nalternatives); off=AC
text=MPS:no plan is persisted,\ntrade-offs are explained
--=A
F.&gt;API : 46: AgentResponse; off=F
API.&gt;GUI : 47: JSON response; off=API
GUI.&gt;U : 48: weekly calendar,\nnutrition totals, warnings
text=GUI:the CLI (MealPlanningCLI) calls\nthe same facade operation\nin-process</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
</diagram>
